# Lifecycle.SemesterBased (P4.B, نظام الفرق) — demo requests against the reference host.
#
# Run the reference host: dotnet run --project src/Hosts/Host.AinShamsUniversity  (http://localhost:5090)
# Its own user secrets: ConnectionStrings:Portal, SEED_ADMIN_EMAIL, SEED_ADMIN_PASSWORD (same keys as Cairo).
# Student Affairs sets up subjects, groups and teaching assignments as usual (http/scheduling.http), then:
#   study plan → promotion policy → generate the term → grades → automatic promotion (decision SEMPROMO).

@host = http://localhost:5090
@adminToken = paste-the-admin-token-here
@studentToken = paste-a-students-token-here
@departmentId = paste-a-department-id-here
@facultyId = paste-a-faculty-id-here
@termId = paste-a-term-id-here
@studentId = paste-a-students-id-here
@subjectId1 = paste-a-subject-id-here
@subjectId2 = paste-another-subject-id-here
@enrollmentId = paste-an-enrollment-id-here
@groupId = paste-a-group-id-here

### Student Affairs: the department's study plan (levels; subjects per level and term)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/study-plans/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "levels": 4,
  "subjects": [
    { "level": 1, "term": "first", "subjectId": "{{subjectId1}}" },
    { "level": 1, "term": "second", "subjectId": "{{subjectId2}}" }
  ]
}

### … and read it back
GET {{host}}/api/admin/study-plans/{{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Promotion settings, university-wide (built in: 3 carried subjects, no gates, 2 years per level, fees required)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/promotion-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### A faculty's own numbers, e.g. a 2+2 programme: level 3 only with everything passed
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/faculties/{{facultyId}}/promotion-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "maxCarriedSubjects": 3, "gateLevels": [3], "maxYearsPerLevel": 2, "requireFeesPaid": true }

### Back to the university's numbers
DELETE {{host}}/api/admin/faculties/{{facultyId}}/promotion-policy
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Generate the term's enrollments (new students start in level 1; carried subjects come along)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/term-enrollments/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "termId": "{{termId}}", "departmentId": "{{departmentId}}" }

### The term's enrollments of one student
GET {{host}}/api/admin/term-enrollments?termId={{termId}}&studentId={{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Move a student to another group of the same subject
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/term-enrollments/{{enrollmentId}}/group
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "subjectGroupId": "{{groupId}}" }

### The department's year groups (فرق)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/cohorts?departmentId={{departmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Place a student in a level (transfers, corrections)
PUT {{host}}/api/admin/standings/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "level": 2 }

### Year-end decisions (publishing the second term's grades decides them automatically)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/promotions?academicYear=2026
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Re-run the decisions of a second term (complete results, undecided or held-and-now-paid)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/promotions/run
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "termId": "{{termId}}" }

### Override the rule for one student
POST {{host}}/api/admin/promotions/override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "studentId": "{{studentId}}", "result": "promoted", "reason": "Excused absence accepted by the faculty council." }

### Student: my year level, carried subjects and latest decision
GET {{host}}/api/standing
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Student: the same schedule and progress routes as CreditHours
GET {{host}}/api/schedule?from=2027-02-06&to=2027-02-19
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
